<title>UK: Credit Local sets $100 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets $100 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg and CCB.  BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    03.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.025   SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
